      "widgets_values": [
        "## 模型下载链接(MiniMax H3 —— 你的盘上基本都在位)\n\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n- [混合权重 hybrid(可选;本机模板用的是 ref2va 单模)](https://huggingface.co/smhfacct/Minimax-H3-fl2va-ref2va-hybrid-models/resolve/main/minimax_h3_hybrid_fl2va_ref2va_b20-49-int8.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n**loras**\n\n- 4 步 turbo:[minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**Latent 上采样器**\n\n- [LBH-123-AI/Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler](https://huggingface.co/LBH-123-AI/Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler/resolve/main/minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_fp16.safetensors?download=true)(你已下过同族 fp16)\n\n## 模型存放位置\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 loras/\n│       └── minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n## 问题反馈\n\n注:请先升级 ComfyUI([指南](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui))并备好所需模型。桌面版/云端版跟随稳定版更新,部分 nightly 才支持的模型可能还没有。\n\n- 跑不了 / 运行报错:[ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- 界面 / 前端问题:[ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- 工作流问题:[workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n-[minimax_h3_hybrid_f2v_ref2va_b2o-49-safetensors](https://huggingface.co/smhfacct/Minimax-H3-fl2va-ref2va-hybrid-models/resolve/main/minimax_h3_hybrid_fl2va_ref2va_b20-49-int8.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n**loras**\n\n- 4 steps: [minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n\n\n**Latent Upscaler**\n\n-[LBH-123-AI/Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler](https://huggingface.co/LBH-123-AI/Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler/resolve/main/minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_fp16.safetensors?download=true)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 loras/\n│       └── minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"
